MITRE ATT&CK
------------

src/attack/schema/attack.yaml, src/attack/datamodel/ and project/ model
MITRE ATT&CK, version 20.0 (13 October 2026), as The MITRE Corporation
(MITRE) publishes it in STIX 2.1 at
https://github.com/mitre-attack/attack-stix-data (tag v20.0). They are
this project's rendering, written in its own words; they are not MITRE's,
and their use does not imply endorsement by MITRE. ATT&CK® is a
registered trademark of The MITRE Corporation.

tests/data/attack-stix-data/ holds ATT&CK objects copied unchanged from
MITRE's bundles, beside MITRE's LICENSE.txt from the same tag, and the
example data under tests/data/ quotes ATT&CK's names and identifiers.
MITRE's licence authorises such copies provided that each reproduces
MITRE's copyright designation and the licence, which are:

  "© 2026 The MITRE Corporation. This work is reproduced and distributed
  with the permission of The MITRE Corporation."

  The MITRE Corporation (MITRE) hereby grants you a non-exclusive,
  royalty-free license to use ATT&CK® for research, development, and
  commercial purposes. Any copy you make for such purposes is authorized
  provided that you reproduce MITRE's copyright designation and this
  license in any such copy.

tests/data/attack-stix-data/LICENSE.txt holds the licence in full, with
MITRE's disclaimers. The bundles themselves are not in this repository:
scripts/fetch_attack_data.py downloads them from MITRE's repository at
the pinned tag into tmp/ and checks each against the hashes in
tests/data/attack-stix-data/manifest.json.

The ATT&CK Data Model
---------------------

The schema follows the ATT&CK Data Model (ADM), which defines ATT&CK's
STIX extensions, at release v4.11.7 of
https://github.com/mitre-attack/attack-data-model (commit
99558689a7efecbb9eec74b1b1a5b6fbfad25f8a), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. No code or text of the ADM is copied here.

